#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "&konqueror; the File Manager"
msgstr "Konqueror ជា​កម្មវិធី​គ្រប់គ្រង​ឯកសារ"

#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "Folders and Paths"
msgstr "ថត​ និង​ផ្លូវ​"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:16
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "In &UNIX; and &Linux; all folders are arranged in a simple inverted tree "
#| "structure descending and branching down from from a single top level "
#| "folder. This means that you can get from any folder to any other by going "
#| "<quote>up</quote> until you reach a common point then <quote>down</quote> "
#| "through the appropriate subfolders until you reach your target."
msgid ""
"In &UNIX; and &Linux; all folders are arranged in a simple hierarchy. "
"Starting from a top level folder (also called the root directory), the "
"structure descends and branches containing various files and subfolders. "
"This means that you can get from any folder to any other by going <quote>up "
"</quote> until you reach a common point then <quote>down</quote> through the "
"appropriate subfolders until you reach your target."
msgstr ""
"នៅក្នុង យូនីក និង លីនុច ថត​ទាំងអស់​គឺ​ត្រូវបាន​រៀបចំ​ជា​រចនា​សម្ព័ន្ធ​មែកធាង​ដែលបាន​ដាក់​បញ្ច្រាសតាម​លំដាប់​ចុះ "
"និង​ជា​មែកធាង​ចុះ​ពី​ថត​កម្រិត​កំពូល​ទោល ។ មាន​ន័យថា អ្នកអាច​យក​ពី​ថតណាមួយ​ទៅ​ថត​ណាមួយ​ដោយ​<quote>​ឡើង​"
"ទៅលើ</quote> រហូត​ទាល់​តែ​អ្នក​ទៅ​ដល់​ចំណុច​ទូទៅ​មួយ​ បន្ទាប់​មក <quote>ចុះក្រោម</quote>​តាម​ថតរង​ដែល​"
"សមរម្យ​រហូត​ទាល់​តែ​អ្នក​ទៅ​ដល់​គោលដៅ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:23
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The position of any file or folder in the tree can be described by its "
#| "<quote>path</quote>, which is a simple list of the folders you would have "
#| "to descend through to get to the target folder or file. For example "
#| "<filename class=\"directory\">/home/pam</filename> is the subfolder "
#| "<filename class=\"directory\">pam</filename> of the subfolder <filename "
#| "class=\"directory\">home</filename> of the top level folder, and "
#| "<filename> /home/pam/words.txt</filename> is the file <filename>words."
#| "txt</filename> in that subfolder. The leading <quote>/</quote> in these "
#| "paths represents the top level folder."
msgid ""
"The position of any file or folder in the structure (also called a directory "
"tree) can be described by its <quote>path</quote>, which is a simple list of "
"the folders you would have to descend through to get to the target folder or "
"file. For example <filename class=\"directory\">/home/pam</filename> is the "
"subfolder <filename class=\"directory\">pam</filename> of the subfolder "
"<filename class=\"directory\">home</filename> of the top level folder, and "
"<filename>/home/pam/words.txt</filename> is the file <filename>words.txt </"
"filename> in that subfolder. The leading <quote>/</quote> in these paths "
"represents the top level folder."
msgstr ""
"ទីតាំង​ឯកសារ​ ឬ​ថត​ណាមួយ​នៅក្នុង​មែកធាង អាច​ត្រូវបាន​ពិពណ៌នា​ដោយ <quote>ផ្លូវ</quote>​របស់​វា ដែល​ជា​"
"បញ្ជី​ថត​សាមញ្ញ​ដែលអ្នក​ត្រូវ​រៀប​តាម​លំដាប់​ចុះ​ ដើម្បី​ទៅដល់​ឯកសារ ឬ​ថត​គោលដៅ ។ ឧទាហរណ៍ <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/home/pam</filename> គឺជា​ថត​រង <filename class=\"directory"
"\">pam</filename> របស់​ថតរង <filename class=\"directory\">ផ្ទះ</filename> របស់​ថត​"
"កម្រិត​កំពូល និង <filename> /home/pam/words.txt</filename> គឺ​ជា​ឯកសារ "
"<filename>words.txt</filename> នៅ​ក្នុង​ថត​រង​នោះ ។ សញ្ញា <quote>/</quote> ដែលនៅពីមុខ​"
"នៅក្នុង​ផ្លូវ​ទាំងនេះ​គឺ​តំណាង​ឲ្យ​ថត​កម្រិត​កំពូល ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:33
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Every folder accessible by your system &mdash; including those on other "
#| "hard disk partitions, your floppy and &CD-ROM; &mdash; will appear in the "
#| "tree descending from /, their exact paths will depend on how your system "
#| "was set up (see also the section on <link linkend=\"floppy-cd\">Floppy "
#| "and &CD-ROM; Drives</link>)."
msgid ""
"Every folder accessible by your system &mdash; including those on other hard "
"disk partitions, a USB device or &CD-ROM; &mdash; will appear in the tree "
"descending from /, their exact paths will depend on how your system was set "
"up (see also the section on <link linkend=\"removable-devices\">Removable "
"Devices</link>)."
msgstr ""
"រាល់​ថត​​ទាំងអស់​អាច​ចូល​ដំណើរការ​តាម​ប្រព័ន្ធ​របស់​អ្នក — ដោយ​រួមមាន​ពួកវា​នៅលើ​ភាគថាស​រឹង​ ថាសទន់ និង ស៊ីឌីរ៉ូម​"
"របស់អ្នក — នឹង​លេចឡើង​នៅក្នុង​ការតម្រៀប​ជា​មែកធាង​លំដាប់​ចុះពី / ដែល​ផ្លូវ​ពិត​ប្រាកដ​របស់​ពួកវា​នឹង​ពឹង​ផ្អែក​"
"លើ​របៀប​ដែលប្រព័ន្ធ​របស់​អ្នកត្រូវបាន​រៀបចំ (សូម​មើល​លើ​ផ្នែក​ <link linkend=\"floppy-cd\">ថាស​"
"ទន់ និង​ដ្រាយ​ស៊ីឌីរ៉ូម</link>) ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Every user on a &UNIX; / &Linux; system has their own <quote>home</quote> "
"folder to hold their personal files and settings; for example <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/home/john</filename> and <filename class=\"directory\">/"
"home/mary</filename>. The symbol <keycap>~</keycap> is often used to "
"represent the user's home folder, so that <filename>~/letter.txt</filename> "
"refers to the file <filename>letter.txt</filename> in my home folder."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​ប្រើ​គ្រប់រូប​នៅលើ​ប្រព័ន្ធ យូនីក / លីនុច មាន​ថត <quote>ផ្ទះ</quote> ផ្ទាល់​ខ្លួន​របស់​គេ ដើម្បី​ទុក​"
"ឯកសារ និង​ការកំណត់​​ផ្លាល់ខ្លួន​របស់​គេ ឧទាហរណ៍ <filename class=\"directory\">/home/john</"
"filename> និង <filename class=\"directory\">/home/mary</filename> ។ សញ្ញា "
"<keycap>~</keycap> គឺ​ត្រូវបាន​ប្រើ​ជាញឹកញាប់​ដើម្បីតំណាង​ឲ្យ​ថត​ផ្ទះ​របស់អ្នក​ប្រើ ដូច្នេះ "
"<filename>~/letter.txt</filename> គឺ​សំដៅ​ទៅលើឯកសារ <filename>letter.txt</"
"filename> នៅក្នុង​ថតផ្ទះ​របស់​ខ្ញុំ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that the term <quote>directory</quote> is often used instead of "
"<quote>folder</quote>."
msgstr ""
"ចំណាំ​ថា ពាក្យ <quote>directory(ថត)</quote> ជាញឹកញាប់​គឺត្រូវបាន​ប្រើ​ជំនួស​ឲ្យ <quote>folder"
"(ថត)</quote> ។"

#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "View Modes"
msgstr "របៀប​មើល"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:51
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The way that &konqueror; displays the files and folders depends mainly on "
#| "your choice of View Mode. This can be selected from the <menuchoice> "
#| "<guimenu>View</guimenu><guisubmenu>View Mode</guisubmenu></menuchoice> "
#| "sub menu, which gives you the following options:"
msgid ""
"In File Manager mode, &konqueror; lists which files and subfolders are "
"contained within a given folder and can provide you with some information "
"about them. The <quote>path</quote> of the current folder is shown in the "
"Location Toolbar. The way that &konqueror; displays the files and folders "
"depends mainly on your choice of view mode which can be selected from the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guisubmenu>View Mode</guisubmenu></"
"menuchoice> sub menu. The view modes &konqueror; provides are outlined below."
msgstr ""
"របៀប Konqueror បង្ហាញ​ឯកសារ និង​ថត​គឺ​ពឹងផ្អែក​យ៉ាង​ចម្បង​លើ​ជម្រើស​របៀបមើល​របស់​អ្នក ។ វា​អាច​"
"ត្រូវបាន​ជ្រើស​ពី​ម៉ឺនុយ​រង <menuchoice> <guimenu>មើល</guimenu><guisubmenu>របៀប​មើល</"
"guisubmenu></menuchoice> ដែលផ្ដល់​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​នូវ​ជម្រើស​ដូច​ខាងក្រោម ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "In File Manager mode, &konqueror; uses an embedded &dolphin; component."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guibutton>Icons</guibutton> view, which is the default, files will "
"be represented by an icon that visualizes the file type, and a folder icon "
"will be shown for subfolders. The names of folders and files are displayed "
"below the icons."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Compact</guilabel> view shows the folder contents as icons "
"with the name beside it grouped in columns similar to the <guilabel>Short "
"View</guilabel> in the &kde; file dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guibutton>Details</guibutton> view, the folder contents are "
"displayed as a detailed list which contains the name, size and last "
"modification time of each item. Additional columns can be added by clicking "
"a column header with the &RMB;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the context menu of the header line you can choose between custom or "
"automatic column width. Automatic width adjusts the width of all columns "
"once to display the longest item in the column completely, except for the "
"<guilabel>Name</guilabel> column where the extension is replaced by \"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "The order of columns can be changed by drag and drop of column headers."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The details view allows you to view a directory in a tree-like fashion if "
"the <guilabel>Expandable folders</guilabel> option is enabled. Each "
"subfolder of the current folder can be <quote>expanded</quote> or "
"<quote>collapsed</quote> by clicking on the <guiicon>&gt;</guiicon> or "
"<guiicon>v</guiicon> icon next to it."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: filemanager.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Grouped View</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: filemanager.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Grouped View</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All view modes support grouping by the sort type selected in "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guisubmenu>Sort by</guisubmenu></"
"menuchoice>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid "File Tip Info"
msgstr "ព័ត៌មាន​ជំនួយ​ឯកសារ"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:122
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Checking the <guilabel>Show file tips</guilabel> box in the <guilabel> "
#| "Behavior</guilabel> page of the &konqueror; Configuration dialog causes a "
#| "small pop up information window to appear when the mouse pointer is "
#| "hovered over a file or folder name or icon in <guimenuitem>Icon View</"
#| "guimenuitem> or <guimenuitem> MultiColumn View</guimenuitem> mode."
msgid ""
"Checking the <guilabel>Show tooltips</guilabel> box in the <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>File Management</guimenu><guimenuitem>General</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> page of the &konqueror; Configuration dialog causes a small pop "
"up information window to appear when the mouse pointer is hovered over a "
"file or folder name or icon."
msgstr ""
"ការធីក​ប្រអប់ <guilabel>បង្ហាញ​ព័ត៌មាន​ជំនួយ​ឯកសារ</guilabel> នៅក្នុងទំព័រ <guilabel>ឥរិយាបទ​</"
"guilabel> របស់​ប្រអប់​កំណត់​រចនា​សម្ព័ន្ធ Konqueror នឹងបង្ក​ឲ្យ​បង្អួច​ព័ត៌មាន​តូច​មួយ​លេចឡើង​​នៅពេល​​ដែល​ដាក់​"
"ទស្សន៍​ទ្រនិច​កណ្ដុរ​ពីលើឈ្មោះ​ ឬ​រូបតំណាង​របស់​ឯកសារ ឬ​ថត​នៅក្នុង​របៀប​ <guimenuitem>ទិដ្ឋភាព​រូប​តំណាង</"
"guimenuitem> ឬ <guimenuitem>ទិដ្ឋភាព​ច្រើន​ជួរឈរ</guimenuitem> ។"

#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "File Previews"
msgstr "មើល​ឯកសារ​ជាមុន​"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:132
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guisubmenu>Preview </"
#| "guisubmenu></menuchoice> from the Menubar will bring up a sub menu that "
#| "lets you enable file previews for certain types of file."
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Previews</guilabel> tab of the <menuchoice><guimenu>File "
"Management</guimenu> <guimenuitem>General</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"settings page lets you enable file previews for certain types of file."
msgstr ""
"ការ​ជ្រើសយក <menuchoice><guimenu>មើល</guimenu><guisubmenu>មើល​ជាមុន</"
"guisubmenu></menuchoice> ពី​របារ​ម៉ឺនុយ នឹង​បង្ហាញ​ម៉ឺនុយ​រង​មួយ​ដែល​អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យអ្នក​បើក​ការមើល​ឯកសារ​"
"ជាមុនដើម្បី​មើល​ប្រភេទ​ពិត​ប្រាកដ​របស់​ឯកសារ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Generally this means that the file's icon will be replaced by a small image "
"showing the file contents."
msgstr "មាន​ន័យថា រូបតំណាង​របស់​ឯកសារ​នឹង​ត្រូវបាន​ជំនួស​ដោយ​រូបភាព​តូច​ដែល​ជំនួស​មាតិកា​ឯកសារ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:137
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Because &konqueror; has to read much more data than just the file name "
#| "details to generate a preview, file previews may not be appropriate when "
#| "viewing files on a floppy or from a remote system. The <guilabel>Previews "
#| "</guilabel> page of the File Manager Configuration dialog allows you to "
#| "disable file previews for protocols such as <link linkend=\"ftp\">ftp</"
#| "link> where reading the extra data would take too long."
msgid ""
"Because &konqueror; has to read much more data than just the file name to "
"generate a preview, file previews may not be appropriate when viewing files "
"from a remote system. To disable previews for remote files where reading the "
"extra data would take too long set a file size limit at the bottom of the "
"<guilabel>Previews</guilabel> tab."
msgstr ""
"ដោយ​សារ Konqueror ត្រូវ​អាន​ទិន្នន័យ​ច្រើន​​ជាង​សេចក្ដីលម្អិត​ឈ្មោះ​ឯកសារ​ដើម្បី​បង្កើត​ការ​មើល​ជា​មុន នោះ​"
"ការ​មើល​ឯកសារ​ជាមុន​​ប្រហែល​ជាមិន​សមរម្យ​ទេ​នៅពេល​ដែល​កំពុង​មើល​ឯកសារ​នៅលើ​ថាសទន់ ឬ​ពី​ប្រព័ន្ធ​ពី​ចម្ងាយ​"
"នោះ ។ ទំព័រ​ <guilabel>មើល​ជាមុន</guilabel> ​របស់​ប្រអប់​កំណត់រចនា​សម្ព័ន្ធ​កម្មវិធី​គ្រប់គ្រ​ឯកសារ​"
"អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​​បិទ​ការមើល​ឯកសារ​ជាមុន​សម្រាប់​ពិធីការ​ដូចជា <link linkend=\"ftp\">ftp</link> "
"ដែលអានទិន្នន័យ​បន្ថែម ហើយ​​ត្រូវ​ចំណាយ​ពេល​យ៉ាង​យូរ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid "Folder View Properties"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The following settings control how the contents of a folder are displayed in "
"the &kappname; view, and are stored on a per-folder basis by default: "
"<itemizedlist> <listitem><para> The view mode (Icons, Compact, Details) </"
"para></listitem> <listitem><para> The sorting of items, which is determined "
"by the sort order (ascending, descending) and the attribute (such as name, "
"size,...) that the items are sorted by </para></listitem> <listitem><para> "
"Sorting of folders and files &ndash; are folders shown first or not? </"
"para></listitem> <listitem><para> Previews &ndash; are they shown instead of "
"icons (based on the settings made in <link linkend=\"previews"
"\"><guilabel>Previews</guilabel> tab of &kappname;'s General settings</"
"link>) or not? </para></listitem> <listitem><para> Are items shown in groups "
"in the views? </para></listitem> <listitem><para> Are hidden files shown? </"
"para></listitem> <listitem><para> What additional information (besides the "
"name) is shown in the Icons or Details view? </para></listitem> </"
"itemizedlist> The view properties can be configured in the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu></menuchoice> menu, some (such as the "
"view mode) can also be changed using toolbar buttons."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid "The View Properties Dialog"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: filemanager.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot of the View Properties dialog"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: filemanager.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid "The View Properties dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid "The View Properties Dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>View Properties</guilabel> dialog can be used to quickly "
"modify several view properties at once. This is done for the current folder, "
"for the current folder including all subfolders, or even for all folders, "
"depending on the choice made in the <guilabel>Apply View Properties To</"
"guilabel> section."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If <guilabel>Use these view properties as default</guilabel> is enabled, the "
"chosen view properties will also be used for all folders which do not have "
"customized view properties yet."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "ការ​រុករក"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To get to a file with &konqueror; you first need to navigate through the "
"folder tree to find the folder containing that file."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី​ស្វែង​រក​ឯកសារ​​ដោយ​ប្រើ Konqueror ដំបូង​អ្នក​ត្រូវ​រុករក​តាម​មែកធាង​ថត​ដើម្បី​រក​ថត​ដែលមាន​ឯកសារ​"
"នោះ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid "To move between folders you can simply step up and down the tree:"
msgstr "ផ្លាស់ទី​នៅ​រវាង​ថត​ដែលអ្នក​អាច​ផ្លាស់ទី​ឡើងលើ និង​ចុះក្រោម​​មែកធាង ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:239
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "To descend into a subfolder <mousebutton>left </mousebutton> click on its "
#| "name or icon -- or if you have already <quote>selected</quote> it (see "
#| "below) -- then just press <keycap>Enter</keycap>."
msgid ""
"To descend into a subfolder <mousebutton>left </mousebutton> click on its "
"name or icon -- or if you have already <quote>selected</quote> it (see "
"below) -- then just press &Enter;."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី​ចូល​ទៅក្នុង​ថត​រង សូម​ចុច​<mousebutton>​កណ្ដុរ​ខាង​ឆ្វេង</mousebutton> លើ​ឈ្មោះ ឬ​រូបតំណាង​របស់​"
"វា -- ឬ​ប្រសិន​បើអ្នក​បាន​​<quote>ជ្រើស</quote> វា​រួចហើយ (សូម​មើល​នៅ​ខាងក្រោម) -- បន្ទាប់​មក​គឺ​"
"គ្រាន់តែ​សង្កត់ <keycap>បញ្ចូល(Enter)</keycap> ប៉ុណ្ណោះ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:243
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "To go up the folder tree you can click on the <guiicon>Up </guiicon> "
#| "button in the Toolbar, use<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keysym>Up "
#| "Arrow</keysym></keycombo>, or use the Menubar <menuchoice><guimenu>Go</"
#| "guimenu><guimenuitem>Up</guimenuitem></menuchoice> option."
msgid ""
"To go up the folder tree you can click on the <guiicon>Up</guiicon> button "
"in the Toolbar, use<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keysym>Up</keysym></"
"keycombo>, or use the Menubar <menuchoice><guimenu>Go</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Up</guimenuitem></menuchoice> option."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី​ឡើង​ទៅ​ខាងលើ​មែកធាង​ថត អ្នក​អាច​ចុចលើ​ប៊ូតុង​ <guiicon>ឡើងលើ</guiicon> នៅក្នុង​របារ​ឧបករណ៍ "
"ឬ​ប្រើ<keycombo action=\"simul\">ជំនួស(Alt)<keysym>ព្រួញ​ឡើងលើ</keysym></keycombo> ឬ​"
"ប្រើ​ជម្រើសរបារ​ម៉ឺនុយ <menuchoice><guimenu>ទៅ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ឡើង​លើ</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To <quote>select</quote> a file or folder in the displayed folder without "
"opening it in any way use the <keysym>up</keysym> and <keysym>down </keysym> "
"arrow keys to move through the items. The selected item will be highlighted "
"and some information about it will be displayed in the Status Bar."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី <quote>ជ្រើស</quote> ឯកសារ ឬ​ថត​នៅក្នុង​ថត​ដែលបាន​បង្ហាញ​ដោយ​មិន​ចាំបាច់​បើក​វា​តាមវិធី​ណាមួយ​"
"នោះ សូម​ប្រើគ្រាប់ចុច​ព្រួញ <keysym>ឡើងលើ</keysym> និង <keysym>ចុះក្រោម</keysym> ដើម្បី​"
"ផ្លាស់ទី​តាម​ធាតុ ។ ធាតុ​ដែលបាន​ជ្រើស​នឹង​ត្រូវបាន​បន្លិច ហើយ​ព័ត៌មាន​អំពី​វា​នឹង​ត្រូវបាន​បង្ហាញ​នៅក្នុង​របារ​"
"ស្ថានភាព ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:255
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Setting the <link linkend=\"viewmode\">View Mode</link> to <guimenuitem> "
#| "Tree View</guimenuitem> can help you locate folders in the tree below the "
#| "current folder; in this mode each folder is shown with a small box at the "
#| "left. If the box contains a <keycap>+</keycap> sign, <mousebutton>left </"
#| "mousebutton> clicking on the box (not on the folder name or icon) will "
#| "display a sub tree showing files and subfolders contained in that folder. "
#| "The small box will then change to show a <keycap>-</keycap> sign. "
#| "<mousebutton>Left</mousebutton> click on that to collapse the sub tree. "
#| "Once you have found the folder you are looking for, <mousebutton>left </"
#| "mousebutton> click on the folder name or icon to open it."
msgid ""
"Setting the <link linkend=\"viewmode\">View Mode</link> to <guimenuitem> "
"Details</guimenuitem> can help you locate folders in the tree below the "
"current folder; in this mode each folder is shown with a small box at the "
"left. If the box contains a <keycap>&gt;</keycap> sign, <mousebutton>left </"
"mousebutton> clicking on the box (not on the folder name or icon) will "
"display a sub tree showing files and subfolders contained in that folder. "
"The small box will then change to show a <keycap>v</keycap> sign. "
"<mousebutton>Left</mousebutton> click on that to collapse the sub tree. Once "
"you have found the folder you are looking for, <mousebutton>left </"
"mousebutton> click on the folder name or icon to open it."
msgstr ""
"ការ​កំណត់ <link linkend=\"viewmode\">របៀប​មើល</link> ឲ្យ​ទៅជា <guimenuitem>ទិដ្ឋភាព​"
"មែកធាង</guimenuitem> អាច​ជួយ​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​រក​ទីតាំង​ថត​នៅក្នុង​មែកធាង​នៅខាងក្រោម​ថត​បច្ចុប្បន្ន ។ នៅក្នុង​"
"របៀប​នេះ ថត​នីមួយៗ​គឺ​ត្រូវបាន​បង្ហាញ​ដោយ​ប្រអប់តូច​នៅខាងឆ្វេង ។ ប្រសិន​បើ​ប្រអប់​មាន​សញ្ញា <keycap>+</"
"keycap> ត្រូវ​ចុច<mousebutton>កណ្ដុរ​ខាង​ឆ្វេង</mousebutton> លើ​ប្រអប់ (មិនមែន​លើ​ឈ្មោះ ឬ​"
"រូបតំណាង​ថត​ទេ) វា​នឹងបង្ហាញមែកធាងរង​ដែលបង្ហាញ​ឯកសារ និង​ថតរក​ដែលមាន​នៅក្នុង​ថត​នោះ ។ បន្ទាប់​មក​"
"ប្រអប់​តូច​នោះ​នឹង​ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរ​ទៅជា​សញ្ញា <keycap>-</keycap> វិញ ។ ចុច​<mousebutton>កណ្ដុរ​"
"ខាងឆ្វេង</mousebutton> លើ​វា​វិញ​ដើម្បី​វេញ​មែក​ធាងរក ។ នៅពេល​ដែល​អ្នក​បាន​រកឃើញ​ថត​ដែលអ្នក​កំពុង​"
"តែ​រក​នោះ ត្រូវ​ចុច​<mousebutton>កណ្ដុរ​ខាង​ឆ្វេង</mousebutton> លើ​ឈ្មោះ​ ឬ​រូបតំណាង​ថត​ដើម្បី​"
"បើកវា ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:266
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The <link linkend=\"sidebar\">Navigation Panel</link> can also help you "
#| "find your way around the file system."
msgid ""
"The <link linkend=\"sidebar\">Sidebar</link> can also help you find your way "
"around the file system."
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"sidebar\">បន្ទះ​រុករក</link> ក៏អាច​ជួយ​អ្នក​ឲ្យ​រក​វិធី​របស់អ្នក​នៅ​ក្បែរៗ​នឹង​ប្រព័ន្ធ​"
"ឯកសារដែរ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:269
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You can go directly to any folder by typing its path into the Location "
#| "Toolbar window or into the dialog box invoked by the Menubar "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Location</guimenu><guimenuitem>Open Location</"
#| "guimenuitem> </menuchoice> item or by <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;"
#| "<keycap> O</keycap></keycombo>. &konqueror;'s <link linkend=\"path-"
#| "complete\"> Text Completion</link> feature may be useful when you do "
#| "this. Don't forget that in &Linux; / &UNIX; file and folder names are "
#| "case sensitive."
msgid ""
"You can go directly to any folder by typing its path into the Location "
"Toolbar window or into the dialog box invoked by the Menubar "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Open Location</guimenuitem> "
"</menuchoice> item or by <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap> O</"
"keycap></keycombo>. &konqueror;'s <link linkend=\"path-complete\"> Text "
"Completion</link> feature may be useful when you do this. Don't forget that "
"in &Linux; / &UNIX; file and folder names are case sensitive."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​អាច​ទៅកាន់​ថត​ណាមួយ​ដោយ​ផ្ទាល់​ ដោយ​វាយ​ផ្លូវ​របស់​វា​ទៅក្នុងបង្អួច​របារ​ឧបករណ៍​ទីតាំង ឬ​ទៅក្នុង​ប្រអប់​"
"ដែលបាន​ហៅមក​ប្រើ​ដោយ​ធាតុ​របារ​ម៉ឺនុយ <menuchoice><guimenu>ទីតាំង</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>បើក​ទីតាំង</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> ឬ​ដោយ​ចុច <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">បញ្ជា(Ctrl)<keycap> O</keycap></keycombo> ។ លក្ខណៈ​ពិសេស <link "
"linkend=\"path-complete\">ការ​បំពេញ​អត្ថបទ</link> របស់ Konqueror អាចមាន​ប្រយោជន៍​នៅពេល​"
"ដែល​ធ្វើវា ។ កុំភ្លេចថា​ នៅក្នុង លីនុច / យូនីក ឈ្មោះ​ឯកសារ និង​ថត​គឺ​ប្រកាន់​តួអក្សរ​តូច​ធំ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:277
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "When you have moved to a new folder you can go back to your previous "
#| "choice by using the Toolbar <guiicon>Back</guiicon> button, the Menubar "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Go</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Back</guimenuitem></"
#| "menuchoice> item, or <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keysym>Left Arrow</"
#| "keysym></keycombo>. Once you have gone back you can go forward. Use the "
#| "Toolbar <guiicon>Forward</guiicon> button, the Menubar "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Go</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Forward</guimenuitem></"
#| "menuchoice> item or <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keysym>Right Arrow</"
#| "keysym></keycombo>."
msgid ""
"When you have moved to a new folder you can go back to your previous choice "
"by using the Toolbar <guiicon>Back</guiicon> button, the Menubar "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Go</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Back</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> item, or <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keysym>Left</keysym></"
"keycombo>. Once you have gone back you can go forward. Use the Toolbar "
"<guiicon>Forward</guiicon> button, the Menubar <menuchoice><guimenu>Go</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Forward</guimenuitem></menuchoice> item or <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keysym>Right</keysym></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"នៅពេល​ដែលអ្នក​បាន​ផ្លាស់ទី​ទៅកាន់​ថត​ថ្មី អ្នក​អាច​ថយក្រោយ​ទៅជម្រើស​មុន​របស់អ្នក​វិញ​ ដោយ​ប្រើប៊ូតុង "
"<guiicon>ថយក្រោយ</guiicon> នៅលើ​របារ​ឧបករណ៍ ឬ​ប្រើធាតុ​​របារម៉ឺនុយ "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>ទៅ</guimenu> <guimenuitem>ថយ​ក្រោយ</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> ឬចុច <keycombo action=\"simul\">ជំនួស(Alt)<keysym>ព្រួញ​ទៅ​ឆ្វេង</"
"keysym></keycombo> ។ នៅពេល​ដែលអ្នក​បាន​ថយ​ទៅក្រោយហើយ អ្នក​ក៏អាច​ទៅមុខវិញ​បានដែរ ដោយ​ប្រើ​ប៊ូតុង​"
"របារ​ឧបករណ៍ <guiicon>ទៅ​មុខ</guiicon> ឬធាតុ​របារ​ម៉ឺនុយ <menuchoice><guimenu>ទៅ</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>ទៅមុខ</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ឬចុច​ <keycombo action="
"\"simul\">ជំនួស(Alt)<keysym>ព្រួញ​ទៅ​ស្ដាំ</keysym></keycombo> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:288
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Alternatively, you can also choose to enter the parent folder by clicking "
#| "on the Toolbar <guiicon>Up</guiicon>, the <menuchoice><guimenu>Go</"
#| "guimenu> <guimenuitem>Up</guimenuitem></menuchoice> item, or with "
#| "<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keysym>Up Arrow</keysym></keycombo>."
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can also choose to enter the parent folder by clicking on "
"the Toolbar <guiicon>Up</guiicon>, the <menuchoice><guimenu>Go</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Up</guimenuitem></menuchoice> item, or with <keycombo action="
"\"simul\">&Alt;<keysym>Up</keysym></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"ច្រាស​មក​វិញ អ្នក​ក៏អាច​ជ្រើស​ដើម្បី​ចូល​ទៅកាន់​​ថត​មេ​បានផងដែរ ​ដោយ​ចុច​លើ​របារ​ឧបករណ៍ <guiicon>ឡើងលើ</"
"guiicon> ឬ​ធាតុ <menuchoice><guimenu>ទៅ</guimenu> <guimenuitem>ឡើង​លើ</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> ឬ​ដោយ​ប្រើ <keycombo action=\"simul\">ជំនួស(Alt)"
"<keysym>ព្រួញ​ឡើងលើ</keysym></keycombo> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:291
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Holding the &LMB; pressed while the mouse pointer is over the Toolbar "
#| "<guiicon>Up</guiicon>, <guiicon>Back</guiicon> or <guiicon>Forward</"
#| "guiicon> buttons brings up a menu of recently visited locations."
msgid ""
"Click the checkmark at the right of the toolbar <guiicon>Up</guiicon>, "
"<guiicon>Back</guiicon> or <guiicon>Forward</guiicon> buttons or selecting "
"these items in the <guimenu>Go</guimenu> menu brings up a submenu of "
"recently visited locations."
msgstr ""
"នៅពេល​ដែល​សង្កត់​ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ខាងឆ្វេង​លើប៊ូតុង​របារ​ឧបករណ៍​ <guiicon>ឡើងលើ</guiicon> <guiicon>ថយ​"
"ក្រោយ</guiicon> ឬ <guiicon>ទៅមុខ</guiicon> ឲ្យ​ជាប់ ពេល​នោះ​វា​នឹង​បង្ហាញ​ទីតាំង​ដែលបាន​ចូល​"
"ទស្សនា​ថ្មី​ៗ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid "Finding Files and Folders"
msgstr "ការ​រក​ឯកសារ និង​ថត"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:299
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you don't know or can't remember where a file or folder is within your "
#| "system, then use the Toolbar <guiicon>Find File</guiicon> button or the "
#| "Menubar <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Find File...</"
#| "guimenuitem></menuchoice> option. This will embed the file finder "
#| "application &kfind; into &konqueror;'s window. See the &kfind; Handbook "
#| "for help in using &kfind;."
msgid ""
"If you don't know or can't remember where a file or folder is within your "
"system, then use the Toolbar <guiicon>Find File</guiicon> button or the "
"Menubar <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Find File...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> option. This starts the file finder application "
"&kfind;. See the <ulink url=\"help:/kfind/index.html\">&kfind; Handbook</"
"ulink> for help in using &kfind;."
msgstr ""
"ប្រសិន​បើ​អ្នក​មិន​ស្គាល់ ឬ​មិន​អាច​ចងចាំ​​​ទីតាំង​របស់​ឯកសារ​ ឬ​ថត​នៅក្នុង​ក្នុង​ប្រព័ន្ធ​របស់​អ្នក​ទេ សូម​ប្រើប៊ូតុង​របារ​"
"ឧបករណ៍ <guiicon>រក​ឯកសារ</guiicon> ឬ​ប្រើ​ជម្រើស​របារ​ម៉ឺនុយ "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>ឧបករណ៍</guimenu><guimenuitem>រក​ឯកសារ...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> ។ វា​នឹង​បង្កប់កម្មវិធី KFind ដែល​ជា​កម្មវិធី​រក ទៅក្នុង​បង្អួច​របស់ Konqueror ។ ចំពោះ​"
"ជំនួយ​ក្នុងការ​ប្រើ KFind សូម​មើល​សៀវភៅ​ដៃ KFind ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:307
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the name of a file or folder begins with a period (dot), then it is a "
"<quote>hidden</quote> file or folder, and will not normally be shown by "
"&konqueror;. To see hidden files or folders use the Menubar <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show Hidden Files</guimenuitem> </"
"menuchoice> option."
msgstr ""
"ប្រសិន​បើ​ឈ្មោះ​របស់​ឯកសារ ឬ​ថត​ចាប់​ផ្ដើម​ដោយ​​ចំណុច (.) គឺ​វា​ជា​ឯកសារ ឬ​ថត​ <quote>ដែលបាន​លាក់</"
"quote> ហើយ​ជាធម្មតា វា​មិន​បង្ហាញ​ឲ្យ​ឃើញ​នៅក្នុង Konqueror ទេ ។ ដើម្បី​មើល​ឯកសារ ឬ​ថត​ដែលបាន​"
"លាក់​នោះ សូម​ប្រើជម្រើស​របារ​ម៉ឺនុយ <menuchoice> <guimenu>មើល</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>បង្ហាញ​ឯកសារ​ដែលលាក់</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:313
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Another reason &konqueror; may not show the file or folder you are looking "
"for is that you may have the <link linkend=\"konq-plugin\"><guisubmenu> View "
"Filter</guisubmenu></link> plugin set to display only certain types of file."
msgstr ""
"មូលហេតុ​មួយទៀត​ដែល Konqueror មិន​បង្ហាញ​ឯកសារ​ ឬ​ថត​ដែលអ្នក​កំពុង​តែ​រក​នោះ គឺ​ប្រហែល​ជាអ្នក​មានកម្មវិធី​"
"ជំនួយ <link linkend=\"konq-plugin\"><guisubmenu> មើល​តម្រង</guisubmenu></link> "
"ដែល​កំណត់​ឲ្យ​បង្ហាញតែ​ឯកសារ​ប្រភេទ​ពិត​តែ​ប៉ុណ្ណោះ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:322
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removable Devices"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:324
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Any floppy disk, &CD; drive or other hard disk partition that you have on "
#| "your system will usually appear in the <filename class=\"directory\">/ </"
#| "filename>, <filename class=\"directory\">/media</filename>, <filename "
#| "class=\"directory\">/mnt</filename> or <filename class=\"directory\">/"
#| "auto</filename> folder, having a path something like <filename class="
#| "\"directory\">/mnt/floppy</filename> or <filename class=\"directory\">/"
#| "cdrom</filename>. The details will depend on how your system was set up."
msgid ""
"Any removable device (USB stick, floppy disk, &CD; drive or other hard disk "
"partition that you have on your system) will usually appear in the <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/ </filename>, <filename class=\"directory\">/media</"
"filename>, <filename class=\"directory\">/mnt</filename> or <filename class="
"\"directory\">/auto</filename> folder, having a path something like "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/mnt/floppy</filename> or <filename class="
"\"directory\">/cdrom</filename>. The details will depend on how your system "
"was set up."
msgstr ""
"ដ្រាយ​ថាសទន់ ដ្រាយ​ស៊ីឌី​រ៉ូម ឬ ភាគថាសរឹង​ដែល​មាន​នៅលើ​ប្រព័ន្ធ​របស់​អ្នក នឹង​ត្រូវបង្ហាញ​នៅក្នុង​ថត "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/ </filename>, <filename class=\"directory\">/"
"media</filename>, <filename class=\"directory\">/mnt</filename> ឬ <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/auto</filename> ដែលមាន​ផ្លូវ​ដូចជា <filename class="
"\"directory\">/mnt/floppy</filename> ឬ <filename class=\"directory\">/cdrom</"
"filename> ។ សេចក្ដី​លម្អិត​គឺ​អាស្រ័យ​ទៅលើ​ការ​របៀបចំ​ប្រព័ន្ធ​របស់អ្នក ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:332
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&UNIX; / &Linux; requires that you <command>mount</command> a floppy disk "
#| "or &CD-ROM; when you have inserted it into the drive, and <command>mount "
#| "</command> other hard disk partitions when you want to access them. You "
#| "also need to unmount a floppy disk or &CD-ROM; before removing it to "
#| "register that it is no longer available."
msgid ""
"&UNIX; / &Linux; requires that you <command>mount</command> a removable "
"device when you have inserted it into the drive, and <command>mount </"
"command> other hard disk partitions when you want to access them. You also "
"need to unmount a removable device before removing it to register that it is "
"no longer available."
msgstr ""
"យូនីក / លីនុច ទាមទារ​ឲ្យអ្នក​ <command>ម៉ោន</command> ថាសទន់ ឬ​ស៊ីឌីរ៉ូម នៅពេល​ដែលអ្នក​បាន​បញ្ចូល​វា​"
"ទៅក្នុង​ដ្រាយ និង​<command>ម៉ោន</command> ភាគថាស​រឹង​មួយទៀត​នៅពេលដែល​អ្នក​ចង់​ចូល​ដំណើរការ​ពួក​វា ។ "
"អ្នក​ត្រូវ​អាន់ម៉ោន​ថាសទន់ ឬ​ស៊ីឌី​រ៉ូម មុនពេល​ដែលអ្នក​យកវាចេញ ដើម្បី​​ឲ្យដឹង​ថា​នឹង​មិនមាន​វា​ទៀត​ទេ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:338
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "How you do this will depend on how your system:"
msgid "How you do this will depend on your system setup:"
msgstr "របៀប​ដែលអ្នក​ធ្វើ​គឺ​​អាស្រ័យ​លើ​របៀប​ដែលប្រព័ន្ធ​របស់​អ្នក​ធ្វើ ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:342
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the <guilabel>Device Notifier</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:343
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In a &kde; session the <ulink url=\"help:/plasma-desktop/index.html#device-"
"notifier\">Device Notifier</ulink> window will popup, when you insert a "
"removable device and allows you to select an appropriate application for "
"this media or only mount the device."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:349
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You may have <guiicon>Floppy</guiicon>, &CD-ROM; and hard disk icons on "
#| "your desktop, in which case &LMB; click on the icon to mount it. Doing "
#| "this should also bring up a &konqueror; window showing the contents of "
#| "the floppy, &CD-ROM; or partition. To unmount, <mousebutton>right</"
#| "mousebutton> click on the icon and choose the <guimenuitem>Unmount</"
#| "guimenuitem> item. Visit the section <link linkend=\"making\">Create "
#| "New...</link> in this Handbook to see how to create such an icon."
msgid ""
"You may have icons for removable devices on your desktop, in which case "
"&LMB; click on the icon to mount it. Doing this should also bring up a "
"&konqueror; window showing the contents of the device. To unmount, "
"<mousebutton>right</mousebutton> click on the icon and choose the "
"<guimenuitem>Unmount</guimenuitem> item. Visit the section <link linkend="
"\"making\">Create New...</link> in this Handbook to see how to create such "
"an icon."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​អាច​មាន​រូបតំណាង <guiicon>ថាស​ទន់</guiicon> ស៊ីឌី​រ៉ូម និង​ថាសរឹងនៅ​លើ​ផ្ទៃតុ​របស់​អ្នក ដើម្បី​ម៉ោន​"
"វា​ ត្រូវ​ចុច​ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​​ខាងឆ្វេង​លើ​រូបតំណាង​នោះ ។ ការ​ចុច​លើ​រូបតំណាង​នោះ នឹង​លេចចេញ​នូវ​បង្អួច​ "
"Konqueror ដែល​បង្ហាញ​​មាតិកា​របស់​ថាសទន់ ស៊ីឌី​រ៉ូម ឬ​ភាគថាស ។ ដើម្បី​អាន់ម៉ោន ត្រូវ​ចុច​"
"<mousebutton>កណ្ដុរ​ខាង​ស្ដាំ</mousebutton> លើ​រូប​តំណាង ហើយ​ជ្រើសយក <guimenuitem>អាន់​"
"ម៉ោន</guimenuitem> ។ ​ដើម្បី​មើល​អំពី​របៀប​បង្កើត​រូប​តំណាង​ទាំង​នោះ សូម​ចូល​ទៅមើល​ផ្នែក <link "
"linkend=\"making\">បង្កើត​ថ្មី...</link> នៅក្នង​សៀវភៅ​ដៃ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:357
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Or you can do it the traditional way by typing into a text console window:"
msgstr "អ្នក​អាច​ធ្វើ​តាម​វិធី​ចាស់ៗ​បាន​ដោយ​វាយ​បញ្ចូល​ទៅក្នុង​បង្អួច​កុងសូល​អត្ថបទ ៖"

#. Tag: command
#: filemanager.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid "mount /mnt/floppy"
msgstr "mount /mnt/floppy"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:360
#, no-c-format
msgid "to mount, for example, the floppy drive, and"
msgstr "ដើម្បី​ម៉ោន ឧទាហរណ៍ ដ្រាយ​ថាសទន់ និង"

#. Tag: command
#: filemanager.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid "umount /mnt/floppy"
msgstr "umount /mnt/floppy"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:362
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"to unmount it (<command>umount</command> not <command>unmount</command>)."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី​អាន់​ម៉ោន​វា (<command>umount</command> មិន​មែន <command>unmount</command>) ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:364
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Rather than having to open a text console to type the <command>mount </"
"command> or <command>umount</command> commands, you may prefer to use "
"&konqueror;'s <menuchoice><guimenu> Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Execute "
"Shell Command</guimenuitem></menuchoice> (<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;"
"<keycap>E</keycap></keycombo>) feature."
msgstr ""
"ប្រសើរ​ជាង​ការ​ដែលត្រូវ​បើក​កុងសូល​អត្ថបទ​ដើម្បី​វាយ​ពាក្យ​បញ្ជា <command>mount </command>  "
"<command>umount</command> អ្នក​អាច​ចូលចិត្ត​ប្រើ​លក្ខណៈ​ពិសេស <menuchoice><guimenu> "
"ឧបករណ៍</guimenu><guimenuitem>ប្រតិបត្តិ​ពាក្យ​បញ្ជា​របស់​សែល</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"របស់ Konqueror (<keycombo action=\"simul\">បញ្ជា(Ctrl)<keycap>E</keycap></"
"keycombo>) ។"

#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:381
#, no-c-format
msgid "Deleting Files and Folders"
msgstr "ការ​លុប​ឯកសារ និង​ថត"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:383
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&konqueror; gives you two ways to dispose of an unwanted file or folder:"
msgstr "Konqueror ផ្ដល់​ឲ្យអ្នក​នូវ​វិធី​ពីរ​​ដើម្បី​បោះចោល​ឯកសារ ឬ​ថត​ដែល​មិន​ត្រូវការ ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:387
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can move it to the <filename>Trash</filename> folder, which is the "
"safest method as you can get it back if you realize that you have made a "
"mistake."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​អាច​ផ្លាស់ទី​វា​ទៅ​ថត <filename>ធុង​សម្រាម</filename> ដែល​​គឺ​ជា​វិធីសាស្ត្រមាន​សុវត្ថភាព​បំផុត ដែល​"
"អ្នក​អាច​យក​វា​មកវិញ​បាន​​ប្រសិន​បើអ្នក​យល់​ឃើញថា អ្នក​បាន​ធ្វើ​មិនត្រឹមត្រូវ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:391
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can just plain Delete it, which removes the entry from the folder and "
"adds the disk area occupied by the file(s) to the system's list of free disk "
"areas, in the same way as the <command>rm</command> command."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​អាច​គ្រាន់​តែ​លុប​វា​ធម្មតា ដែល​យក​ធាតុ​ចេញ​ពី​ថត និង​បន្ថែម​ផ្ទៃ​ថាស​ដែលបាន​ប្រើ​លើ​​​ឯកសារ​នៃ​បញ្ជី​ផ្ទៃ​ថាស​"
"ទំនេរ​របស់​ប្រព័ន្ធ គឺ​ដូច​គ្នា​នឹង​ប្រើ​ពាក្យ​បញ្ជា <command>rm</command> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:395
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to use this feature check the option <guilabel>Show 'Delete' "
"menu entries which bypass the trashcan</guilabel> on the <guilabel>File "
"Management</guilabel> settings page."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:400
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The simplest way to remove a file or folder is to position the mouse pointer "
"over its name or icon and press the &RMB;, which will bring up a menu "
"containing the options <guimenuitem>Move to Trash</guimenuitem> and "
"<guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"វិធី​សាមញ្ញ​បំផុត​ក្នុងការ​ផ្លាស់ទី​ឯកសារ ឬ​ថត គឺ​ត្រូវ​ដាក់​ទស្សន៍​ទ្រនិច​កណ្ដុរលើ​ឈ្មោះ ឬ​រូប​តំណាង​វា ហើយ​សង្កត់​ប៊ូតុង​"
"កណ្ដុរ​ខាង​ស្ដាំ បន្ទាប់​មក​ជ្រើស​យក​ជម្រើស <guimenuitem>ផ្លាស់ទី​ទៅ​ធុង​សម្រាម</guimenuitem> និង "
"<guimenuitem>លុប</guimenuitem> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:405
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Or, if you have <quote>selected</quote> the item, the Menubar <guimenu>Edit</"
"guimenu> menu will give you the choice of <quote><guimenuitem>Move to Trash</"
"guimenuitem></quote> and <quote><guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem></quote> "
"options."
msgstr ""
"ឬ ប្រសិន​បើអ្នក​បាន​<quote>ជ្រើស</quote>ធាតុ​រួច​ហើយ ម៉ឺនុយ​របារ​ម៉ឺនុយ <guimenu>កែ​សម្រួល</"
"guimenu> នឹង​ផ្ដល់​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​នូវ​ជម្រើស <quote><guimenuitem>ផ្លាស់ទី​ទៅធុង​សម្រាម</guimenuitem></"
"quote> និង <quote><guimenuitem>លុប</guimenuitem></quote> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:410
#, no-c-format
msgid "<keycap>Del</keycap> will move the selected item or items to Trash."
msgstr "<keycap>លុប(del)</keycap> នឹង​ផ្លាស់ទី​ធាតុ​ដែលបាន​ជ្រើស​ ឬ​ធាតុ​ទៅ​ធុង​សម្រាម ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:412
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Shift;<keycap>Del</keycap></keycombo> will "
"really, truly and irrevocably delete the selected item or items."
msgstr ""
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">ប្ដូរ(Shift)<keycap>លុប(Del)</keycap></keycombo> នឹង​លុប​"
"ធាតុ​ដែលបាន​ជ្រើស ឬ​ធាតុ​យ៉ាង​ពិត​ប្រាកដ ហើយ​មិន​អាច​ស្ដារ​មក​វិញ​បានឡើយ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:416
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You won't be able to remove a file or folder if you don't have the "
#| "necessary permissions; see the section on <link linkend=\"super-user"
#| "\">Super User Mode</link> for further details."
msgid ""
"You won't be able to remove a file or folder if you don't have the necessary "
"permissions."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​មិន​អាច​យក​ឯកសារ ឬ​ថត​ចេញ​បានទេ ប្រសិន​បើអ្នក​មិនមាន​សិទ្ធិ​នោះ ។ ចំពោះ​សេចក្ដី​លម្អិត​បន្ថែម សូម​មើល​"
"ផ្នែក <link linkend=\"super-user\">របៀប​អ្នក​ប្រើ​ជាន់​ខ្ពស់</link> ។"

#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:423
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moving and Copying"
msgstr "ការ​ផ្លាស់ទី និង​ការ​ចម្លង"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:425
#, no-c-format
msgid "To copy a file or subfolder between folders you can:"
msgstr "ដើម្បី​ចម្លង​ឯកសារ ឬ​ថតរង​ពីថត​មួយ​ទៅ​ថត​មួយ អ្នក​អាច ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:428
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Position the mouse pointer over its name or icon and hold down the &RMB;, "
"which will bring up a menu containing the <guimenuitem>Copy</guimenuitem> "
"option. Choose that."
msgstr ""
"ដាក់​ទស្សន៍​ទ្រនិច​កណ្ដុរ​ពី​លើ​ឈ្មោះ ឬ​រូប​តំណាង​របស់វា ហើយ​ចុច​ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ខាង​ស្ដាំ វា​នឹង​បង្ហាញម៉ឺនុយ​មួយ​ បន្ទាប់​មក​​"
"ជ្រើស​យក <guimenuitem>ចម្លង</guimenuitem> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:432
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Or if the item is <quote>selected</quote> you can use the <guiicon>Copy</"
#| "guiicon> button on the Toolbar or the Menubar <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</"
#| "guimenu> <guimenuitem>Copy</guimenuitem></menuchoice> item, or the "
#| "<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo> shortcut "
#| "key combination. You can also select <link linkend=\"multiple\">multiple</"
#| "link> files or folders to copy/move as well."
msgid ""
"Or if the item is <quote>selected</quote> you can use the <guiicon>Copy</"
"guiicon> button on the Toolbar or the Menubar <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Copy</guimenuitem></menuchoice> item, or the <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo> shortcut key "
"combination. You can also select <link linkend=\"selection\">multiple</link> "
"files or folders to copy/move as well."
msgstr ""
"ឬ ប្រសិន​បើអ្នក​បាន​​<quote>ជ្រើស</quote>​ធាតុរួច​ហើយ អ្នក​អាច​ប្រើ​ប៊ូតុង <guiicon>ចម្លង</"
"guiicon> នៅលើ​របារ​ឧបករណ៍ ឬ​ធាតុ​របារ​ម៉ឺនុយ <menuchoice><guimenu>កែ​សម្រួល</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>ចម្លង</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ឬ​ចុច​បន្សំ​គ្រាប់ចុច​ផ្លូវកាត់​<keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">បញ្ជា(Ctrl)<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo> ។ អ្នក​ក៏អាច​​ចម្លង​/ផ្លាស់ទី​"
"ឯកសារ ឬ​ថត​​<link linkend=\"multiple\">ច្រើន</link>​បានផងដែរ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:441
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Navigate to the folder you want to copy the item into then Paste the item "
"into the new folder by using the Toolbar <guiicon>Paste</guiicon> button or "
"the Menubar <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Paste</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> option or the <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;"
"<keycap>V</keycap></keycombo> shortcut, or by moving the mouse pointer to a "
"clear area of the window and holding the &RMB; down to bring up a menu "
"containing the <guimenuitem>Paste</guimenuitem> option."
msgstr ""
"រុករក​ថត​ដែលអ្នក​ចង់​ដាក់​ធាតុ​ដែលបាន​ចម្លង បន្ទាប់​មក​​បិទភ្ជាប់​ធាតុ​ទៅក្នុង​ថត​ថ្មី​នោះ​ដោយ​ប្រើប៊ូតុង​ "
"<guiicon>បិទភ្ជាប់​</guiicon> នៅក្នុង​របារ​ឧបករណ៍ ឬ ជម្រើស​របារ​ម៉ឺនុយ "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>កែ​សម្រួល</guimenu> <guimenuitem>បិទភ្ជាប់</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> ឬ​ប្រើ​ផ្លូវកាត់ <keycombo action=\"simul\">បញ្ជា(Ctrl)<keycap>V</"
"keycap></keycombo> ឬ​ដោយ​ផ្លាស់ទី​ទស្សន៍​ទ្រនិច​កណ្ដុរ​ដាក់លើ​តំបន់​ទំនេរនៅក្នុង​បង្អួច បន្ទាប់​មក​ចុច​ប៊ូតុង​"
"កណ្ដុរ​ខាង​ស្ដាំ ហើយ​ជ្រើស​យក​ជម្រើស <guimenuitem>បិទភ្ជាប់</guimenuitem> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:452
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Moving a file or subfolder between folders can be done in the same way as "
"copying, except that you choose the <guimenuitem>Cut</guimenuitem> option or "
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>X</keycap></keycombo> instead of "
"<guimenuitem>Copy</guimenuitem>. The item that you have <guimenuitem>Cut</"
"guimenuitem> will be removed from the original folder when you do the "
"<guimenuitem>Paste</guimenuitem> into the new folder."
msgstr ""
"ការ​ផ្លាស់ទី​ឯកសារ ឬ​ថតរក​ពីថត​មួយ​ទៅ​ថត​មួយ គឺ​អាច​ធ្វើបាន​តាម​វិធី​ដូច​ចម្លង​ដែរ តែ​ខុស​ត្រង់ថា អ្នក​ត្រូវ​ជ្រើស​"
"យក​ជម្រើស <guimenuitem>កាត់</guimenuitem> ឬ​ប្រើ <keycombo action=\"simul\">បញ្ជា"
"(Ctrl)<keycap>X</keycap></keycombo> ជំនួស​ឲ្យ <guimenuitem>ចម្លង</guimenuitem> ។ "
"ធាតុ​ដែលអ្នក​បាន​​<guimenuitem>កាត់</guimenuitem> នឹង​ត្រូវបាន​ផ្លាស់ទី​ពី​ថត​ដើម​នៅពេល​"
"ដែលអ្នក<guimenuitem>បិទភ្ជាប់</guimenuitem>​វា​ទៅក្នុង​ថត​ថ្មី ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:461
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You can also copy or move selected item(s) to another folder by using "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Copy Files</"
#| "guimenuitem></menuchoice> (<keycap>F7</keycap>) or "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Move Files</guimenuitem> "
#| "</menuchoice> (<keycap>F8</keycap>), or by selecting <guimenuitem>Copy "
#| "To</guimenuitem> or <guimenuitem>Move To</guimenuitem> from the drop down "
#| "menu you get when you <mousebutton>right</mousebutton> click on an file "
#| "or folder name in the File Manager window."
msgid ""
"You can also copy or move selected item(s) to another folder by selecting "
"<guimenuitem>Copy To</guimenuitem> or <guimenuitem>Move To</guimenuitem> "
"from the context menu you get when you <mousebutton>right</mousebutton> "
"click on an file or folder name in the File Manager window."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​ក៏អាច​ចម្លង ឬ​ផ្លាស់ទីធាតុ​ដែលបាន​ជ្រើស​ទៅ​កាន់​ថត​ផ្សេងទៀត ដោយ​ប្រើ <menuchoice><guimenu>កែ​"
"សម្រួល</guimenu> <guimenuitem>ចម្លង​ឯកសារ</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"(<keycap>F7</keycap>) ឬ <menuchoice><guimenu>កែ​សម្រួល</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>ផ្លាស់ទី​ឯកសារ</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> (<keycap>F8</"
"keycap>) ឬ​ដោយ​ជ្រើស <guimenuitem>ចម្លង​ទៅ</guimenuitem> ឬ <guimenuitem>ផ្លាស់ទី​ទៅ</"
"guimenuitem> ពី​ម៉ឺនុយ​ទម្លាក់​ចុះដែល​អ្នក​ឃើញវា​នៅពេល​ដែលអ្នក​ចុច​​<mousebutton>កណ្ដុរ​ខាង​ស្ដាំ</"
"mousebutton> លើ​ឈ្មោះ​ឯកសារ ឬ​ថត​នៅក្នុង​កម្មវិធីគ្រប់គ្រង​ឯកសារ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:465
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guisubmenu>Preview </"
#| "guisubmenu></menuchoice> from the Menubar will bring up a sub menu that "
#| "lets you enable file previews for certain types of file."
msgid ""
"To enable this feature select <guilabel>Show 'Copy To' and 'Move To' "
"commands</guilabel> on the <menuchoice><guimenu>File Management</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Services</guimenuitem></menuchoice> page of the settings."
msgstr ""
"ការ​ជ្រើសយក <menuchoice><guimenu>មើល</guimenu><guisubmenu>មើល​ជាមុន</"
"guisubmenu></menuchoice> ពី​របារ​ម៉ឺនុយ នឹង​បង្ហាញ​ម៉ឺនុយ​រង​មួយ​ដែល​អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យអ្នក​បើក​ការមើល​ឯកសារ​"
"ជាមុនដើម្បី​មើល​ប្រភេទ​ពិត​ប្រាកដ​របស់​ឯកសារ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:468
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You may not be able to copy or move a file or folder if you don't have "
#| "the necessary permissions. See the section on <link linkend=\"super-user"
#| "\">Super User Mode</link> for further details."
msgid ""
"You may not be able to copy or move a file or folder if you don't have the "
"necessary permissions."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​មិនអាច​​ចម្លង ឬ​ផ្លាស់ទី​ឯកសារ​បានទេ ប្រសិន​បើ​អ្នក​មិនមាន​សិទ្ធិ​នោះ ។ ចំពោះ​សេចក្ដី​លម្អិត​បន្ថែម សូម​មើល​"
"ផ្នែក <link linkend=\"super-user\">របៀប​អ្នក​ប្រើ​ជាន់​ខ្ពស់</link> ។"

#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:474
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using Drag 'n Drop"
msgstr "ការ​ប្រើប្រាស់​ការ​អូស ហើយទម្លាក់"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:476
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&konqueror; also supports Drag and Drop copying and moving of files and "
"folders."
msgstr "Konqueror ក៏គាំទ្រ​ការ​ចម្លង និង​ការ​ផ្លាស់ទី​ឯកសារ និង​ថត​ដោយ​ប្រើ​ ការអូស និង​​ទម្លាក់​ផង​ដែរ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:479
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You can do this by having two instances of &konqueror;, one showing the "
#| "folder you want to copy from, the other showing the target folder. "
#| "Position the mouse pointer over the item you wish to copy or move, then, "
#| "holding the &LMB; pressed, <quote>drag</quote> it to a clear space in the "
#| "target folder. Release the button and you will be presented with a menu "
#| "choice of <guimenuitem>Copy</guimenuitem> or <guimenuitem>Move</"
#| "guimenuitem>. Take care to <quote>drop</quote> the item into an empty "
#| "area of the target folder view - dropping it on top of another file name "
#| "or icon can cause problems."
msgid ""
"You can do this by having two instances of &konqueror;, one showing the "
"folder you want to copy from, the other showing the target folder. Position "
"the mouse pointer over the item you wish to copy or move, then, holding the "
"&LMB; pressed, <quote>drag</quote> it to a clear space in the target folder. "
"Release the button and you will be presented with a menu choice of "
"<guimenuitem>Copy Here</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Move Here</guimenuitem> "
"or <guimenuitem>Link Here</guimenuitem>. Take care to <quote>drop</quote> "
"the item into an empty area of the target folder view - dropping it on top "
"of a subfolder will copy or move the item into that folder."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​អាច​ធ្វើ​ដូច​នេះ​បាន​ គឺ​ត្រូវ​មាន​វត្ថុ​របស់ Konqueror ពីរ មួយ​គឺ​បង្ហាញ​ថត​ដែល​អ្នក​ចង់​ចម្លង​ធាតុ​ និង​មួយ​"
"ទៀត​បង្ហាញ​ថត​គោល​ដៅ ។ ដាក់​ទស្សន៍​ទ្រនិច​កណ្ដុរ​ពី​លើ​ធាតុ​ដែលអ្នក​ចង់​ចម្លង ឬ​ផ្លាស់ទី បន្ទាប់​មក​ចុច​ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​"
"ខាង​ឆ្វេង <quote>អូស</quote> វា​ទៅកាន់​ផ្ទៃ​ទទេ​នៅក្នុង​ថត​គោល​ដៅ ។ លែង​ប៊ូតុង ហើយ​អ្នក​នឹង​ឃើញម៉ឺនុយ​​ឲ្យ​"
"ជ្រើស​រើស <guimenuitem>ចម្លង</guimenuitem> ឬ <guimenuitem>ផ្លាស់ទី</guimenuitem> ។ "
"ប្រុងប្រយ័ត្ន​ក្នុងការ <quote>ទម្លាក់</quote> ធាតុ​ទៅកាន់​ផ្ទៃ​ទទេ​ររបស់​ទិដ្ឋភាព​ថត​គោល​ដៅ - ការ​"
"ទម្លាក់​វា​ទៅលើ​​ឈ្មោះ ឬ​រូបតំណាង​ឯកសារ​ផ្សេង គឺ​អាច​បង្ក​ឲ្យ​មាន​បញ្ហា ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:490
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also set up &konqueror; to show more than one folder within its "
"window and drag &amp; drop between them."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​ក៏អាច​រៀបចំ​ឲ្យ Konqueror បង្ហាញ​ថត​ច្រើន​នៅក្នុង​បង្អួច​របស់​វា​បានដែរ ហើយ​អ្នក​អាច​អូស និង​ទម្លាក់​ពី​"
"ថតមួយ​ទៅថត​មួយ​បាន ។"

#. Tag: phrase
#: filemanager.docbook:496
#, no-c-format
msgid "Split Views for Drag &amp; Drop"
msgstr "ការ​ពុះទិដ្ឋភាព​សម្រាប់​ការ​អូស ​និង​ទម្លាក់"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:500
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This screenshot illustrates the use of the Menubar "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Window</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Split View Left/Right</"
#| "guimenuitem></menuchoice> option, also available with the shortcut "
#| "<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>L</keycap> </keycombo>, "
#| "to split the main &konqueror; window into two views, each showing the "
#| "contents of a different folder."
msgid ""
"This screenshot illustrates the use of the Menubar "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Window</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Split View Left/Right</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> option, also available with the shortcut <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>L</keycap></keycombo>, to split the "
"main &konqueror; window into two views, each showing the contents of a "
"different folder."
msgstr ""
"រូប​ថត​អេក្រង់​នេះ បង្ហាញ​អំពី​ការ​ប្រើ​ជម្រើស​របារ​ម៉ឺនុយ <menuchoice><guimenu>បង្អួច</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>ពុះទិដ្ឋភាព ឆ្វេង​/​ស្ដាំ​</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ឬ​ក៏អាច​ប្រើផ្លូវកាត់​ "
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">បញ្ជា(Ctrl)​ប្ដូរ(Shift)<keycap>L</keycap> </"
"keycombo> ដើម្បី​ពុះ​បង្អួច Konqueror មេ​ជា​ពីរ​ទិដ្ឋភាព ហើយ​ទិដ្ឋភាព​នីមួយៗ បង្ហាញមាតិកា​ថត​ផ្សេង​"
"គ្នា ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:507
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To be able to show different folders in each view they should not be linked; "
"the little boxes at the bottom right of each view should be empty."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី​អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​បង្ហាញ​ថត​ផ្សេងគ្នា​នៅក្នុងទិដ្ឋភាព​នីមួយៗ គឺ​មិន​ចាំបាច់​តភ្ជាប់​ពួកវា​ទេ ប្រអប់​តូចៗ​នៅ​ខាង​ស្ដាំ​"
"បាត​នៃ​ទិដ្ឋភាព​នីមួយៗ​ គឺ​ត្រូវ​តែ​ទទេ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:511
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <quote>active</quote> view, that is the one whose path is shown in the "
"Location Toolbar and which responds to navigation and Menubar commands, is "
"shown by the little green light in the bottom left corner. To make a view "
"active, <mousebutton>left</mousebutton> click on an empty area of the view "
"or on its Status Bar."
msgstr ""
"ទិដ្ឋភាព <quote>សកម្ម</quote> គឺ​ជា​ទិដ្ឋភាព​ដែល​ផ្លូវ​របស់​វា​ត្រូវបាន​បង្ហាញ​នៅក្នុង​របារ​ឧបករណ៍​ទីតាំង "
"និង​ឆ្លើយ​តប​ទៅនឹង​ការ​រុករក និង​ពាក្យ​បញ្ជា​របារ​ម៉ឺនុយ ហើយ​វា​ត្រូវបាន​បង្ហាញ​ដោយ​ពន្លឺ​ពណ៌​បៃតង​តូច​នៅ​ជ្រុង​បាត​"
"ខាង​ឆ្វេង ។ ដើម្បី​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​ទិដ្ឋភាព​សកម្ម ចុច​<mousebutton>កណ្ដុរ​ខាង​ឆ្វេង</mousebutton> លើ​ផ្ទៃ​"
"ទទេ​របស់​ទិដ្ឋភាព ឬ​នៅលើ​របារ​ស្ថាន​ភាព ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:517
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "To remove an active view from &konqueror;'s window use the <keycombo "
#| "action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>R</keycap> </keycombo> shortcut, or "
#| "the Menubar <menuchoice><guimenu>Window</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Remove "
#| "Active View</guimenuitem></menuchoice> option, or &RMB; click on the "
#| "Status Bar and choose the <guimenuitem>Remove Active View</guimenuitem> "
#| "option from the resulting menu."
msgid ""
"To remove an active view from &konqueror;'s window use the <keycombo action="
"\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>W</keycap></keycombo> shortcut, or the "
"Menubar <menuchoice><guimenu>Window</guimenu><guimenuitem>Close Active View</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> option, or &RMB; click on the Status Bar and "
"choose the <guimenuitem>Close View</guimenuitem> option from the resulting "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី​យក​ទិដ្ឋភាព​សកម្ម​ចេញ​ពីបង្អួច Konqueror គឺត្រូវ​ប្រើ​ផ្លូវកាត់ <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">បញ្ជា(Ctrl)ប្ដូរ(Shift)<keycap>R</keycap> </keycombo> ឬ​ប្រើ​ជម្រើស​របារ​ម៉ឺនុយ "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>បង្អួច</guimenu> <guimenuitem>បិទ​ទិដ្ឋភាព​សកម្ម</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> ឬ​ចុច​ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ខាង​ស្ដាំ​លើ​របារ​ស្ថាន​ភាព ហើយ​ជ្រើស​ជម្រើស <guimenuitem>បិទ​ទិដ្ឋភាព​"
"សកម្ម</guimenuitem>​ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:524
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you use &konqueror; tabs, you can drag and drop between tabs by dragging "
"the file to the tab label, without letting go yet. The destination tab will "
"pop to the front, allowing you to continue dragging and then drop the file."
msgstr ""
"ប្រសិន​បើអ្នក​ប្រើ​ផ្ទាំង​របស់ Konqueror អ្នក​អាច​អូស និង​ទម្លាក់​ពី​ផ្ទាំង​មួយ​ទៅ​ផ្ទាំង​មួយ​ទៀត​ដោយ​អូសឯកសារ​"
"ទៅកាន់​ស្លាក​ផ្ទាំង ដោយ​កុំទាន់​ព្រលែង​វា ។ ផ្ទាំង​គោលដៅ នឹង​លេចឡើង​មក​ខាង​មុខ ដែល​អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យអ្នក​បន្ត​"
"ធ្វើការ​អូស និង​ទម្លាក់​ឯកសារ​បាន ។"

#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:532
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Duplicate File Names"
msgid "Duplicate File or Folder Names"
msgstr "ឈ្មោះ​ឯកសារ​ស្ទួន​គ្នា"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:533
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you try to paste a file into a folder that already contains a file "
#| "with the same name, &konqueror; will pop up a dialog box warning you that "
#| "the file already exists. You can then choose to:"
msgid ""
"If you try to paste a file or folder into a folder that already contains an "
"item with the same name, &konqueror; will pop up a dialog box warning you "
"that the item already exists. You can then choose to:"
msgstr ""
"ប្រសិន​បើអ្នក​សាកល្បង​បិទភ្ជាប់​ឯកសារ​នៅក្នុង​ថត​​មួយ​ដែលមាន​ឯកសារ​មាន​ឈ្មោះ​ដូចគ្នា ពេល​នោះ Konqueror "
"នឹង​លេចឡើង​នូវ​ប្រអប់​ព្រមាន​​​មួយ​ថា​ មាន​ឯកសារ​រួចហើយ ។ ពេល​នោះ​អ្នក​អាច​ជ្រើស ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:538
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Cancel the paste operation by pressing the <guibutton>Skip </guibutton> "
#| "or <guibutton>Skip All</guibutton> button."
msgid ""
"Cancel the paste operation by pressing the <guibutton>Cancel </guibutton> "
"button."
msgstr ""
"បោះបង់​ការ​បិទភ្ជាប់​ដោយ​ចុច​លើ​ប៊ូតុង <guibutton>រំលង</guibutton> ឬ <guibutton>រំលង​ដោយ​ស្វ័យ​"
"ប្រវត្តិ</guibutton> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:540
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Give the file that is being copied a different name. You can do this by "
#| "typing a new name into the text entry box or get &konqueror; to "
#| "<guibutton>Propose</guibutton> one. When you have done this press the "
#| "<guibutton>Rename</guibutton> button."
msgid ""
"Give the item that is being copied a different name. You can do this by "
"typing a new name into the text entry box or get &konqueror; to "
"<guibutton>Suggest New Name</guibutton>. When you have done this press the "
"<guibutton>Continue</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"ផ្ដល់​ឈ្មោះ​ថ្មី​ឲ្យ​ឯកសារ​ដែលបាន​ចម្លង ។ អ្នក​អាច​ធ្វើ​ដូច​នេះ​បាន​ដោយ​វាយ​បញ្ចូល​ឈ្មោះ​ថ្មី​ទៅក្នុង​ប្រអប់​ធាតុ​"
"អត្ថបទ ឬ​ឲ្យ Konqueror <guibutton>ស្នើឈ្មោះ​ថ្មី</guibutton> ឲ្យ​ក៏បាន ។ នៅពេល​ដែល​អ្នក​បាន​"
"ធ្វើ​រួច សូម​ចុច​ប៊ូតុង​ <guibutton>បន្ត</guibutton> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:544
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have copied multiple items, <guibutton>Skip</guibutton> the current "
"item."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:548
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<guilabel>Overwrite</guilabel> the old file with the newly copied one. "
#| "The <guibutton>Overwrite All</guibutton> button can be used if you have "
#| "copied multiple items."
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Apply to All</guibutton> button can be used if you have "
"copied multiple items."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>សរសេរ​ជាន់​លើ</guilabel>​ឯកសារ​ចាស់​ដោយ​ឯកសារ​ដែលបាន​ចម្លង​ថ្មី ។ ​ប៊ូតុង ​"
"<guibutton>សរសេរ​ជាន់​លើ​ទាំងអស់</guibutton> អាច​ត្រូវបាន​ប្រើ​នៅពេល​ដែល​អ្នក​បាន​ចម្លង​ធាតុ​"
"ច្រើន ។"

#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:554
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Selecting Multiple Files"
msgid "Selecting Items in the View"
msgstr "ការ​ជ្រើស​ឯកសារ​ច្រើន"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:556
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are several ways to select items in the view. Once a group of items is "
"selected, all actions, such as <menuchoice><guimenuitem>Cut</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>, <menuchoice><guimenuitem>Copy</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, "
"<menuchoice><guimenuitem>Move to Trash</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, and drag "
"and drop operations, affect all selected items."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:566
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selecting Items Using the Mouse"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:570
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can press the &LMB; somewhere in the view and draw a rectangle around a "
"group of items before releasing the button. This will select all items in "
"the rectangle and clear the previous selection. If the &Shift; key is "
"pressed during the selection process, the previous selection is kept."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:577
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the &Ctrl; key is pressed while an item is clicked with the &LMB;, the "
"selection state of this item is toggled. If the &Ctrl; key is pressed while "
"a rectangle is drawn around a group of items as described above, the "
"selection state of all items in the rectangle will be toggled."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:584
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the &Shift; key is pressed while an item is clicked with the &LMB;, all "
"items between the previous current item and the clicked item will be "
"selected."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:589
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If <guilabel>Show selection marker</guilabel> is enabled in the "
"<guilabel>Behavior</guilabel> tab of the <menuchoice><guimenu>File "
"Management</guimenu> <guimenuitem>General</guimenuitem></menuchoice> section "
"of the settings, a small <guiicon>+</guiicon> or <guiicon>-</guiicon> button "
"appears in the top left corner of the item which is currently hovered with "
"the mouse. Clicking this sign selects or deselects the item, respectively."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:603
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selecting Items Using the Keyboard"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:607
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If an arrow key, <keycap>Page Up</keycap>, <keycap>Page Down</keycap>, "
"<keycap>Home</keycap>, or <keycap>End</keycap> is pressed, the new current "
"item is selected, and the previous selection is cleared."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:613
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the &Ctrl; key is held while one of the above keys is pressed, the "
"selection remains unchanged."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:618
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the &Shift; key is held while one of the above keys is pressed, all items "
"between the previous current item and the new current item will be selected."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:623
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Shift;<keycap>Del</keycap></keycombo> will "
#| "really, truly and irrevocably delete the selected item or items."
msgid ""
"If <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keysym>Space</keysym></keycombo> is "
"pressed, the selection state of the current item is toggled."
msgstr ""
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">ប្ដូរ(Shift)<keycap>លុប(Del)</keycap></keycombo> នឹង​លុប​"
"ធាតុ​ដែលបាន​ជ្រើស ឬ​ធាតុ​យ៉ាង​ពិត​ប្រាកដ ហើយ​មិន​អាច​ស្ដារ​មក​វិញ​បានឡើយ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:628
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Shift;<keycap>Del</keycap></keycombo> will "
#| "really, truly and irrevocably delete the selected item or items."
msgid ""
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>A</keycap></keycombo> selects all "
"items in the view."
msgstr ""
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">ប្ដូរ(Shift)<keycap>លុប(Del)</keycap></keycombo> នឹង​លុប​"
"ធាតុ​ដែលបាន​ជ្រើស ឬ​ធាតុ​យ៉ាង​ពិត​ប្រាកដ ហើយ​មិន​អាច​ស្ដារ​មក​វិញ​បានឡើយ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:633
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Shift;<keycap>Del</keycap></keycombo> will "
#| "really, truly and irrevocably delete the selected item or items."
msgid ""
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>A</keycap></keycombo> "
"toggles the selection state of all items in the view."
msgstr ""
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">ប្ដូរ(Shift)<keycap>លុប(Del)</keycap></keycombo> នឹង​លុប​"
"ធាតុ​ដែលបាន​ជ្រើស ឬ​ធាតុ​យ៉ាង​ពិត​ប្រាកដ ហើយ​មិន​អាច​ស្ដារ​មក​វិញ​បានឡើយ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:638
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select a file or folder by typing the first few letters of its name and the "
"first matching item is selected. To clear the selection and cancel the "
"keyboard search press &Esc; or wait longer than the timeout of 1 second."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:651
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selecting Items Using the Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:653
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You sometimes want to delete, copy or move a number of files that are "
"similar in some way. For example you may wish to move all of the .png "
"graphics files from one folder to another. &konqueror; makes this easy by "
"letting you select multiple files based on similarities in their file names."
msgstr ""
"ពេល​ខ្លះ អ្នក​ចង់​លុប ចម្លង ឬ​ផ្លាស់ទី​ចំនួន​ឯកសារ​ដែលស្រដៀង​គ្នា​ក្នុង​វិធីណាមួយ ។ ឧទាហរណ៍ អ្នក​ចង់​ផ្លាស់ទី​"
"ឯកសារ​ក្រាហ្វិក .png ទាំងអស់​ពីថត​មួយ​ទៅ​ថត​មួយ​ទៀត ។ Konqueror ធ្វើ​ការ​នេះ​បាន​យ៉ាង​ងាយស្រួល ដោយ​"
"អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យអ្នក​ជ្រើស​ឯកសារ​ច្រើន ដែល​ពឹង​ផ្អែកលើ​ភាព​ស្រដៀងគ្នា​នៅក្នុងឈ្មោះ​ឯកសារ​របស់​វា ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:658
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Use the Menubar <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guisubmenu>Selection</"
#| "guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Select...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> item or the "
#| "shortcut <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>+</keycap></keycombo>. "
#| "This brings up a little dialog box in which you enter a filename "
#| "containing the wildcard characters <keycap>*</keycap>, which matches any "
#| "number of characters, and <keycap>?</keycap> which matches a single "
#| "character. Press <guibutton>OK</guibutton> and &konqueror; will highlight "
#| "all files with matching names. For example;"
msgid ""
"Use the Menubar <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guisubmenu>Selection</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Select Matching Items...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"option or the shortcut <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></"
"keycombo>. This brings up a little dialog box in which you enter a filename "
"containing the wildcard characters <keycap>*</keycap>, which matches any "
"number of characters, and <keycap>?</keycap> which matches a single "
"character. Press <guibutton>OK</guibutton> and &konqueror; will highlight "
"all files with matching names. For example:"
msgstr ""
"ប្រើ​ធាតុ​របារ​ម៉ឺនុយ <menuchoice><guimenu>កែសម្រួល</guimenu><guisubmenu>ការ​ជ្រើស​រើស</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>ជ្រើស...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ឬ​ប្រើ​ផ្លូវកាត់ "
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">បញ្ជា(Ctrl)<keycap>+</keycap></keycombo> ។ វា​នឹង​"
"បង្ហាញ​ប្រអប់​តូច​មួយ​ដែល​អ្នក​បញ្ចូល​ឈ្មោះ​ឯកសារ​ដែលមាន​តួអក្សរ​ជំនួស <keycap>*</keycap> ដែល​ផ្គូផ្គង​"
"ទៅនឹង​តួអក្សរ​ណា​មួយ ហើយ​តួអក្សរ <keycap>?</keycap> ផ្គូផ្គង​នឹង​តួអក្សរ​ទោល ។ សង្កត់ "
"<guibutton>យល់ព្រម</guibutton> ហើយ​ Konqueror នឹង​បន្លិច​ឯកសារ​ទាំងអស់​​ដោយ​ឈ្មោះ​"
"ដែលផ្គូរផ្គង ។ ឧទហរណ៍ ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:669
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput><filename>flag*.png</filename></userinput> will select all "
"filenames starting with the letters <quote>flag</quote> and ending with "
"<quote><literal role=\"extension\">.png</literal></quote>."
msgstr ""
"<userinput><filename>flag*.png</filename></userinput> នឹង​ជ្រើស​ឈ្មោះ​ឯកសារ​ដែលចាប់​"
"ផ្ដើម​ដោយ​តួអក្សរ <quote>flag</quote> និង​បញ្ចប់​ដោយ <quote><literal role=\"extension"
"\">.png</literal></quote> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:672
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput><filename>memo?.txt</filename></userinput> will select "
"<filename>memo1.txt</filename> and <filename>memo9.txt</filename> but not "
"<filename>memo99.txt</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<userinput><filename>memo?.txt</filename></userinput> នឹង​ជ្រើស <filename>memo1."
"txt</filename> និង <filename>memo9.txt</filename> ប៉ុន្តែ​មិន​មែន <filename>memo99."
"txt</filename> ទេ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:677
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "When you have selected a range of files, you can narrow down the "
#| "selection by uing the Menubar <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu> "
#| "<guimenuitem>Unselect...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> option or <keycombo "
#| "action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>-</keycap></keycombo> to specify which of "
#| "the selected files should be removed from the selection."
msgid ""
"When you have selected a range of files, you can narrow down the selection "
"by using the Menubar <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Selection</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Unselect Matching "
"Items...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> option to specify which of the selected "
"files should be removed from the selection."
msgstr ""
"នៅពេល​ដែល​អ្នក​បានជ្រើស​ជួរ​ឯកសារ អ្នក​អាច​បន្ថយ​ការ​ជ្រើស​រើស​បាន​ដោយ​ប្រើ​ជម្រើស​របារ​ម៉ឺនុយ "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>កែ​សម្រួល</guimenu> <guisubmenu>ការ​ជ្រើស​រើស</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>មិន​ជ្រើស...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ឬ​ប្រើ <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">បញ្ជា(Ctrl)<keycap>-</keycap></keycombo> ដើម្បី​បញ្ជាក់​ឯកសារ​ដែល​បាន​"
"ជ្រើស​ណាមួយ​ដែលត្រូវ​យក​ចេញ​ពី​ការ​ជ្រើស​រើស ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:683
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Use <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>U</keycap></keycombo> or the "
#| "Menubar <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Unselect All</"
#| "guimenuitem></menuchoice> option or just &LMB; click on a clear area of "
#| "the view to cancel the selection."
msgid ""
"Use the Menubar <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guisubmenu>Selection</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Unselect All</guimenuitem></menuchoice> option or "
"just &LMB; click on a clear area of the view to cancel the selection."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី​បោះបង់​ការ​ជ្រើស​រើស ត្រូវ​ប្រើ <keycombo action=\"simul\">បញ្ជា(Ctrl)<keycap>U</"
"keycap></keycombo> ឬ​ជម្រើស​របារ​ម៉ឺនុយ <menuchoice><guimenu>កែ​សម្រួល</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>ការ​ជ្រើស​រើស</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>មិន​ជ្រើស​ទាំងអស់</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> ឬ​គ្រាន់​តែ​ចុច​លើ​ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ខាង​ឆ្វេងលើ​ផ្ទៃ​ទទេ​នៃ​ទិដ្ឋភាព ។"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:688
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You can even invert the selection: that is, deselect all selected files "
#| "and select those that were previously unselected. Use the Menubar "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Invert Selection</"
#| "guimenuitem></menuchoice> option or <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;"
#| "<keycap>*</keycap></keycombo> to do this."
msgid ""
"You can even invert the selection: that is, deselect all selected files and "
"select those that were previously unselected. Use the Menubar "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guisubmenu>Selection</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Invert Selection</guimenuitem></menuchoice> option "
"or <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>A</keycap></keycombo> to "
"do this."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​ក៏អាច​ត្រឡប់​ជម្រើស​ ៖ នោះ​គឺ វាដោះ​ជ្រើសឯកសារ​ដែលបាន​ជ្រើស ហើយទៅ​ជ្រើស​ឯកសារ​ដែលមិន​បាន​ជ្រើស​"
"ពីមុន​វិញ ។ ប្រើជម្រើស​របារ​ម៉ឺនុយ <menuchoice><guimenu>កែ​សម្រួល</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>ត្រឡប់​ជម្រើស</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ឬ​ប្រើ <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">បញ្ជា(Ctrl)<keycap>*</keycap></keycombo> ដើម្បី​ធ្វើ​ការ​ត្រឡប់​នេះ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: filemanager.docbook:699
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create New"
msgstr "បង្កើត​ថ្មី"

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:701
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When &konqueror; is in File Manager mode, picking <guisubmenu>Create New</"
"guisubmenu> from the <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> menu or from the context menu "
"you get by &RMB; clicking on a free area in a folder view gives you a "
"submenu letting you create any of the following in the current folder:"
msgstr ""
"នៅពេល​ដែល Konqueror ដំណើរ​ការ​ជារបៀប​គ្រប់គ្រង​ឯកសារ ចូរ​ជ្រើស​យក <guisubmenu>បង្កើត​ថ្មី</"
"guisubmenu> ពី​ម៉ឺនុយ <guimenu>កែ​សម្រួល</guimenu> ឬ​ពី​ម៉ឺនុយ​បរិបទ​ដែលអ្នក​បាន​មក​ដោយ​ចុច​ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​"
"ខាង​ស្ដាំ​លើ​ផ្ទៃ​ទទេ​នៅក្នុង​ទិដ្ឋភាព​ថត ដែល​ផ្ដល់​ឲ្យអ្នក​នូវ​ម៉ឺនុយ​រង​ដែល​អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យអ្នក​បង្កើតណាមួយ​ខាងក្រោម​"
"នៅក្នុង​ថត​បច្ចុប្បន្ន ៖"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: filemanager.docbook:710
#, no-c-format
msgid "Folder..."
msgstr "ថត​..."

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:711
#, no-c-format
msgid "An easy way of creating a new (sub)folder."
msgstr "វិធី​ងាយៗ​ក្នុងការ​បង្កើត​ថត(រង)​ថ្មី ។"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: filemanager.docbook:715
#, no-c-format
msgid "Text File..."
msgstr "ឯកសារ​អត្ថបទ​..."

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:716
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use this to create an ordinary, empty, text file. A dialog box will be "
"opened for you to enter the name of your new file."
msgstr ""
"ប្រើ​វា​ដើម្បី​បង្កើត​​ឯកសារ​អត្ថបទ ឯកសារ​សាមញ្ញ ឯកសារ​ទទេ ។ ប្រអប់​មួយ​នឹង​ត្រូវបាន​បើក​ដើម្បី​ឲ្យអ្នក​បញ្ចូល​"
"ឈ្មោះ​ឯកសារ​ថ្មី​របស់​អ្នក ។"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: filemanager.docbook:722
#, no-c-format
msgid "HTML File..."
msgstr "ឯកសារ HTML..."

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:723
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Creates a skeleton <acronym>HTML</acronym> source file. When you type the "
"new file's name into the dialog box it is probably best to give it a "
"<literal role=\"extension\">.html </literal> extension to avoid confusion."
msgstr ""
"បង្កើត​គ្រោង​ឯកសារ​ប្រភព <acronym>HTML</acronym> ។ នៅពេល​ដែលអ្នក​វាយ​ឈ្មោះ​ឯកសារ​ថ្មី​ទៅក្នុង​"
"ប្រអប់ គឺ​ត្រូវ​វាយ​បញ្ចូល​ពាក្យ​បន្ថែម <literal role=\"extension\">.html </literal> ដើម្បី​"
"ជៀសវាង​ការ​ច្រឡំ ។"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: filemanager.docbook:730
#, no-c-format
msgid "<replaceable>Type of Document</replaceable> Document..."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:731
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Depending on the installed applications and file associations several "
"menuitems for different types of documents are displayed and enable you to "
"create skeleton documents of the selected type."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: filemanager.docbook:737
#, no-c-format
msgid "Link to Location (URL)..."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: filemanager.docbook:738
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This lets you create an icon to open &konqueror; at a particular folder "
#| "or web page. As with <guimenuitem>Link To Application...</guimenuitem> "
#| "you can make the application icon appear on your desktop by creating the "
#| "link in your <filename>~/Desktop</filename> folder or going to the "
#| "<guisubmenu>Create New...</guisubmenu> sub menu by right clicking on a "
#| "free area of the desktop. When you first create it the text shown with "
#| "the icon will be the full path or &URL;. You can change it by right "
#| "clicking on the icon, selecting <guimenuitem>Properties...</guimenuitem> "
#| "and entering the preferred text in the <guilabel>General</guilabel> tab "
#| "page."
msgid ""
"This lets you create an icon to open &konqueror; at a particular folder or "
"web page. As with <guimenuitem>Link To Application...</guimenuitem> you can "
"make the application icon appear on your desktop by creating the link in "
"your <filename>~/Desktop</filename> folder or going to the "
"<guisubmenu>Create New...</guisubmenu> sub menu by right clicking on a free "
"area of the desktop."
msgstr ""
"វា​អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យអ្នក​បង្កើត​រូប​តំណាង​ដើម្បី​បើក Konqueror នៅថត ឬ​ទំព័រ​បណ្ដាញ​ណា​មួយ ។ ដូច​គ្នា​នឹង "
"<guimenuitem>តំណ​ទៅ​កម្មវិធី​...</guimenuitem> ដែរ អ្នក​អាច​​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​រូប​តំណាង​របស់​​កម្មវិធី​លេចឡើង​"
"នៅលើ​ផ្ទៃតុ​របស់អ្នក​ដោយ​បង្កើត​តំណ​ទៅកាន់​ថត <filename>~/Desktop</filename> របស់​អ្នក ឬ​ទៅកាន់​"
"ម៉ឺនុយ​រង <guisubmenu>បង្កើត​ថ្មី...</guisubmenu> ដោយ​ចុច​កណ្ដុរ​ខាង​ស្ដាំ​លើ​ផ្ទៃ​ទទេ​របស់​ផ្ទៃតុ ។ "
"នៅពេលដែល​អ្នក​បាន​បង្កើត​វា​ដំបូង អត្ថបទ​បាន​បង្ហាញ​ដោយ​រូបតំណាង​ដែល​ជា​ផ្លូវ ឬ URL ពេញលេញ ។ អ្នក​អាច​"
"ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរវា​ដោយ​ការ​ចុច​កណ្ដុរ​ខាង​ស្ដាំលើ​រូប​តំណាង ដែល​ការចុចលើ <guimenuitem>លក្ខណៈ​សម្បត្តិ...</"
"guimenuitem> និង​ការ​បញ្ចូលអត្ថបទ​ដែល​ចូល​ចិត្ត​ទៅក្នុង​ទំព័រ​ផ្ទាំង <guilabel>ទូទៅ</guilabel> ។"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: filemanager.docbook:747
#, no-c-format
msgid "Basic link to file or directory..."
msgstr ""

